From: Rowan Castell <rowan.castell@ferncastle.example>
To: Dana Whitfield <dana.whitfield@hangs-gc.example>
Cc: Attest team <attest@finance-demo.example>
Subject: Received: FY2026 financial statements and compliance certificate
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:12:00 -0700
Message-ID: <FCB-HGC-FY2026-RECEIPT@ferncastle.example>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
MIME-Version: 1.0

Dana,

This confirms that the bank received HANGS General Contracting LP's financial=
 statements for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2026 and the signed compliance=
 certificate today, October 23, 2026, through our secure upload.

Received on: October 23, 2026
Documents: FY2026 financial statements; FY2026 compliance certificate signed =
October 22, 2026

As agreed, the attest team is copied and will perform the covenant procedures=
 in the engagement letter.

Rowan Castell
Vice President, Commercial Lending, Ferncastle Bank

